{
  "id": "phy6-c5-s9",
  "card_id": "phy6-c5-s9",
  "chapter": "功和功率、能量",
  "section": null,
  "number": "76",
  "title": "机械效率",
  "printed_title": "76. 机械效率",
  "start_page": 203,
  "start_printed": 192,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 4,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "研究杠杆的结构和作用原理时，我们曾忽略摩擦和杠杆本身的重量。\n在这种理想条件下，施加在杠杆上的动力所做的功，称为**总功**；\n它等于提升重物或克服某种阻力所做的**有用功**。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "在我们研究杠杆的结构和作用原理时，我们没有考虑摩擦以及杠杆本身的重量. 在这种理想的条件下，加在杠杆上的动力所做的功（我们把这个功叫做**总功**）等于提升重物或克服某种阻力所做的**有用功**.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "实际使用机械时，**所做的总功总是多于有用功**，因为一部分功还要用于克服机械中的摩擦阻力，以及使机械的某些部件移动。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "而实际上，**使用机械时所做的总功总是多于有用功**，因为有一部分功要用于克服机械中的摩擦阻力及使机械的一些部件发生移动.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，用动滑轮提升重物时，还要做一部分附加的功，用来提升滑轮本身和绳子，并克服滑轮轴处的摩擦。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "例如，使用动滑轮提升重物时，不得不为了提高滑轮本身和绳子以及克服滑轮轴处的摩擦而做一部分附加的功.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "对于上述实际机械，有用功只是总功的一部分。\n用$A_{\\text{有用}}$表示有用功，用$A$表示总功，可以写成",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "不管我们使用的是什么机械，做的有用功都只是总功的一部分. 因此，若用字母$A_{\\text{有用}}$表示有用功，用$A$表示总功，则可写成",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A_{\\text{有用}}<A$，\n或$\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}<1$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "$A_{\\text{有用}}<A$, 或$\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}<1$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**有用功与总功的比值称为机械效率**，用符号$K$表示，即",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "**有用功与总功的比值称为机械效率**，用符号$K$表示，即有",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "机械效率通常表示为百分数，即",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "通常都将机械效率表示成百分数的形式，即",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}\\times100\\%$。\n**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "**$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}\\times100\\%$.**",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**例题：**在杠杆的短臂上挂一个质量为100千克的重物。\n为了提升它，在长臂上施加一个250牛顿的力。\n重物被提升的高度为$h_1=0.08$米，动力作用点下降的高度为$h_2=0.4$米，求杠杆的机械效率。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "**例题.** 在杠杆的短臂上挂一个质量为100千克的重物.为提升此重物而在长臂上施加一个250牛顿的力. 若重物被提升的高度为$h_1=0.08$米，而动力的作用点下降的高度为$h_2=0.4$米，试求此杠杆的机械效率.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**解：**重物的重量为$P=gm$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "**解：**重物的重量$P=gm$，",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "本例按教材的近似取值计算：\n$P=9.8$牛顿/千克$\\times100$千克$\\approx1000$牛顿。\n有用功为$A_{\\text{有用}}=Ph_1$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "$P=9.8$牛顿/千克$\\times100$千克$\\approx1000$牛顿. 有用功$A_{\\text{有用}}=Ph_1$，",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A_{\\text{有用}}=1000$牛顿$\\times0.08$米$=80$焦耳。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "$A_{\\text{有用}}=1000$牛顿$\\times0.08$米$=80$焦耳.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "总功为$A=Fh_2$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "总功$A=Fh_2$，",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=250$牛顿$\\times0.4$米$=100$焦耳。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$A=250$牛顿$\\times0.4$米$=100$焦耳.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "机械效率为$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}\\times100\\%$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "机械效率$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}\\times100\\%$，",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "按上述近似计算，**$K=\\frac{80\\text{焦耳}}{100\\text{焦耳}}\\times100\\%=80\\%$。\n**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "**$K=\\frac{80\\text{焦耳}}{100\\text{焦耳}}\\times100\\%=80\\%$.**",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
